---
title: Resolution cascade - two tool shapes, one verdict type
---
flowchart TD
    S{"file-path tool<br/>or command tool?"}

    S -->|"Read / Write / Edit"| F1["check_file_path_hard_deny<br/>pooled across all levels"]
    F1 -->|"hard match - a deny,<br/>which the floor exempts"| RV["RuntimeVerdict"]
    F1 -->|"no match"| F2["resolve_file_path_permission<br/>most-specific-level-wins"]
    F2 --> FL

    S -->|"Bash / MCP terminal"| B1["compound.decompose<br/>PEG grammar"]
    B1 --> B2["per sub-command:<br/>hard-deny, then<br/>resolve_command_permission"]
    B2 --> B3["_combine_strictest<br/>deny > ask > allow"]
    B3 --> FL

    FL["parse-failure ASK floor<br/>applied last, both cascades<br/>an existing deny is never weakened"]
    FL --> RV

    classDef verdict fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#3f8f47,color:#12331a
    classDef floor fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#c07a1e,color:#3a2708
    class RV verdict
    class FL,F1 floor
